<title>BELGIUM: Belgian GIMV to be listed at 2,010 Bfr per share.</title>
<headline>Belgian GIMV to be listed at 2,010 Bfr per share.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>GIMV, the investment company of the Flemish regional government, will be listed on the Brussels bourse at 2,010 francs per share, brokerage Petercam said on Monday.</p>
<p>The price was fixed after book-building with institutionals within a price range of 1,920 and 2,250 francs. Shares will be offered to private investors from Tuesday, June 10. The offer will be closed on June 17 at the latest.</p>
<p>GIMV, Flanders' largest venture capital company, is listing a maximum 19.9 percent of its capital from June 26.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
